Some interesting outputs from our initial work on the long-term experiment project [BLANDSKAP](https://www.slu.se/om-slu/organisation/institutioner/institutionen-for-tillampad-husdjursvetenskap-och-valfard/forskning/blandskap/).
where we report the effects of periodic grazing exclusion using virtual fencing on the plant and pollinator
communities in a Swedish semi-natural grassland.

